      "message": "@panikiel@google.com has added implementation of alternate interface support for osx. CL:3694246\n\nSince it is not possible to do it right now for windows (we need to change `AdbWinApi.dll` for that, but changing prebuild dll isn\u0027t allowed anymore), can we proceed with the current implementation?",
      "revId": "bea437ee8236227e2fe1db8f2e6056aa3f7fb5d7",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
